[Music]  [Music]  i get lots of comments and questions see  if game of thrones prequel series is  cancelled people say they are reading  about it all over the internet the  answer is yes one game of thrones  prequel is cancelled its name was the  long knight or the blood moon but the  other game of thrones prequel series  house of the dragon about which i've  been talking about on this channel is  not the game of thrones prequel series  house of the dragon is in the process of  filming and will be released early on in  2022 or in other words in just over one  year  unlike the long night prequel hbo  ordered the entire first season of house  of the dragon meaning that this prequel  cannot be cancelled hbo's prequel blood  moon was meant to fill the gap that game  of thrones left behind but a project has  been cancelled and replaced with house  of the dragon if the long night prequel  was not cancelled it would already be  out as 2020 was its official release  date  blood moon was supposed to be about the  long night at first it seemed as if  everything was going just fine with it  and hbo even filmed the pilot but for  whatever reason chose not to turn it  into a series  a pilot episode was written and produced  by jane goldman said thousands of years  before game of thrones hours after  announcing that the blood moon prequel  was cancelled hbo announced that they  ordered the entire first season of house  of the dragon  pilots sometimes they come together  sometimes they don't hbo's president  casey blois told variety about why the  network decided to go with one prequel  series over the other and i would say  that was very much the case here there's  nothing i would point to and say oh this  was the problem however bloise did  reveal that since house of the dragon is  based on martin's writing it was easier  for the show's creative team to delve  into the story of house targaryen that  prequel was 8 000 years before the  current show so it required a lot more  invention he explained one of the  benefits of house of the dragon is there  was a text from george and there was a  little bit more of a roadmap  set more than 5000 years before game of  thrones the cancelled show blood moon  was not planning to feature any of the  game of thrones characters we already  know and love as a matter of fact some  of the houses and families did not even  exist in this time period like  targaryens for example  according to hbo's official synopsis the  blood moon was meant to tell the story  of the world's descent from the golden  age of heroes into its darkest hour  it planned to center around the children  of the forest and how they created the  first white walker we now know as the  night king a teaser for the series said  it will reveal the horrifying secrets of  westeros history to the true origin of  the white walkers the age of heroes is  the name given to the period in time  which saw the first men and the children  of the forest come together to agree on  a piece pact this happened around 10 000  years before the first game of thrones  episode is set it ended around 7 000  years later with the coming of the  andals the exact time the age of heroes  ended is not clear as different sources  in westeros gave different accounts  this meant that the fans would not know  for sure when the blood moon was set the  only details confirmed were that it's  the age of hero zera casey blow is the  president of hbo programming told  deadline one of the things i think jane  took on beautifully which was a  challenge there was a lot more world  creation because she set hers 8 000  years before the original show so it  required a lot more he added we would  have been very lucky to do one pilot  have that pilot go and be a success but  in development as you know it takes a  lot of tries to get it right this is no  different in an interview with  entertainment weekly the creator george  r martin stated that blood moon prequel  was supposed to be set roughly 5 000  years before the events of the game of  thrones we are dealing with a different  and older world martin told the  entertainment weekly in the interview  georgia or martin also said westeros is  a very different place king's landing  will not even exist yet and as a result  there is no iron throne either meanwhile  valyria will have hardly begun to rise  martin explained it's not the story we  think we know it will teach us more  about westeros history the white  walker's origins and the mysteries of  the east in his interview with the new  york times martin stressed that the long  night prequel was mostly the creation of  jane goldman in his own words if you  look at the published books so far  there's really very little material  about the age of heroes and the long  night a sentence here a sentence there  old nan tells a tale that takes up a  paragraph so jane had to create the  characters the settings and some of the  events and we had to look at everything  that was said and say okay here's what  was said at this point we need to make  it consistent to that we kicked around  some ideas and i made some suggestions  but mostly it's been jane running with  it martin therefore explained that he  did not create the plot outline  characters or setting details for the  long night tv series it was announced by  hbo on october 29th 2019 that plans to  produce the long night spin-off had been  scrapped after viewing the pilot hbo was  not thrilled by the results and even  gave showrunner jane goldman and her  team notes on change as needed but even  after the re-edit of the pilot hbo was  still not thrilled and decided not to  green light the pilot to series hours  after the cancellation that same day hbo  greenlighted instead another game of  thrones prequel direct to sirius that's  co-created by george r martin and ryan  condole  kondo will be a co-show runner with  famous game of thrones director miguel  sapochnick who will also work on the  pilot and additional episodes in the  prequel series called house of the  dragons  house of the dragon will draw from  georgia or martin's novel fire and blood  which reveals more about the history of  the targaryens

